            "paragraph": "The link between settlement patterns and climate remains debated in Amazonian archaeology. Meggers (1994) proposed that mega-Ni\u00f1o events, with high temperatures and extreme droughts, caused major discontinuities in the archaeological record (c. 1500, 1000, 700 and 400 BP).",
