            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "A 818O analysis from the Caverna Jumandy, located 11km north-east of Pashimbi, exhibits strong coherence with tropical Pacific sea-surface temperature anomalies observed in Andean and Amazonian records (Jim\u00e9nez-I\u00f1iguez et al. 2022).",
