            "paragraph": "Likewise, research at Papallacta, a transitional zone between the Andes and the Amazonian foothills, shows that vegetation and soil moisture have responded to El Ni\u00f1o events and the South American Summer Monsoon over the past 5000 years (Ledru et al. 2013, 2022).",
