            "target_entity_instance": "northern Peruvian Amazon",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "This settlement process associated with moisture reduction is also evidenced in palaeoecological records from lakes such as Sauce and Pomacochas (Bush et al. 2016, 2017; \u00c5kesson et al. 2020), where an increase in agricultural activity is observed during these dry episodes in the northern Peruvian Amazon.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
