            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "The discontinuities in human settlements were possibly associated with flooding caused by increased precipitation during La Ni\u00f1a events (Arellano 2019). Archaeological evidence in the Pashimbi region shows the existence of settlements established on alluvial terraces (Guzman et al. 2019; Sol\u00f3rzano 2021), indicating that these settlements were vulnerable to flooding.",
